  "reasoning": "The facts describe that the defendant operated an unlicensed small electroplating business, failed to treat wastewater, and discharged wastewater containing heavy metal chromium at levels three times the legal limit, causing serious environmental pollution. The prosecution explicitly states that the conduct constitutes an environmental pollution crime and requests prosecution under the relevant criminal law provision. Therefore, the appropriate charge is the crime of environmental pollution (illegal discharge of pollutants).",
